  "evidence_scope": "The three supplied single-turn chats are assessed against the synthetic fixture. No executed payment lookup, write, send, transport, runtime consent enforcement, or real receipt is evidenced. The case metadata says NOT RUN; supplied replies support text-level assessment only. Additional branches and fresh repeats are NOT RUN.",
